  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $\\frac{d x}{d t}=4 t^3-3 k t^2$\n$\\frac{d v}{d t}=12 t^2-6 \\mathrm{kt}$ at $\\mathrm{t}=2$\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{\\mathrm{dv}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=0,48-12 \\mathrm{k}=0 \\quad ; \\mathrm{k}=4$",
